{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32255","headline":"经旧游 · 温庭筠","name":"经旧游","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"珠箔金钩对彩桥，昔年於此见娇娆。\n香灯怅望飞琼鬓，凉月殷勤碧玉箫。\n屏倚故窗山六扇，柳垂寒砌露千条。\n坏墙经雨苍苔遍，拾得当时旧翠翘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"温庭筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32255.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32255","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}